# public-repo-generator <https://github.com/east-van-ai/public-repo-generator>
# weed-out <https://github.com/east-van-ai/weed-out>

.git/
.gitignore
.weed-out-ignore
src/**/*.py
# The stack directories ship data beside their scripts. A *.py-only keep list
# carves out a tool that cannot find an interpreter or a requirements file, and
# the failure only shows up on someone else's machine.
src/carbonara/stacks/*/python-version
src/carbonara/stacks/*/requirements.txt
src/carbonara/stacks/*/requirements-pinned.txt
tests/*.py
CHANGELOG.md
docs/CALLS-HOME.md
docs/CLI.md
docs/DESIGN.md
LICENSE
pyproject.toml
README.md
